# Single source of truth for AI rules

**CLAUDE.md** at the repo root is the entry point for every development and AI-assistant rule in
this repository. Some rules live in files under `REFERENCE/claude-md/`. CLAUDE.md names each of
those files in a pointer that says when to read it, so open the file a pointer names whenever its
trigger applies. Cursor and Claude Code must both follow CLAUDE.md and the files it points to. Do
**not** add or duplicate rules in this file. Edit CLAUDE.md, or the file a pointer names, instead.
This stub only points Cursor at the entry point.

@CLAUDE.md
